<ac:structured-macro ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This is a note callout.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="tip" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This is a tip callout.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="note" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This is an important callout.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="warning" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This is a warning callout.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>A multi-block callout: the blank quoted line between blocks has no trailing space.</p><ul><li>alpha</li><li>beta</li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
